@startuml machine-command-state-diagram
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title MACHINE SERVICE - MACHINE COMMAND STATE

[*] --> ACCEPTED : create command
ACCEPTED --> PROCESSING : execution starts
ACCEPTED --> ACKNOWLEDGED : acknowledge(at)
PROCESSING --> ACKNOWLEDGED : acknowledge(at)
ACKNOWLEDGED --> DISPENSED : complete(success=true)
ACKNOWLEDGED --> FAILED : complete(success=false)
PROCESSING --> DISPENSED : complete(success=true)
PROCESSING --> FAILED : complete(success=false)
ACCEPTED --> EXPIRED : expiry job
PROCESSING --> EXPIRED : expiry job
ACKNOWLEDGED --> EXPIRED : expiry job
ACCEPTED --> UNKNOWN : uncertain outcome
PROCESSING --> UNKNOWN : uncertain outcome

DISPENSED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
EXPIRED --> [*]
UNKNOWN --> [*]

note right of ACKNOWLEDGED
  Các transition acknowledge/complete có trong entity.
  Inbound device adapter gọi chúng chưa được triển khai.
end note

@enduml
